# Code owners — automatic reviewer assignment.
#
# Today every path resolves to the same person. The split is still worth having:
# when a second maintainer joins, giving them the storage code is a one-line edit
# rather than an argument about who reviews what. Ownership here reflects which
# areas need *which kind* of scrutiny, not who happens to be available.
#
# Last matching pattern wins.

